      "text": "Buttplug of the Bimbo: made of magic black vibranium, shaped like anaconda, comes with a remote control with three functions, can be used on men and women, includes a spellbook of power words.\n\nPower Words- \n\n\"BBC\": \"Once plugged and activated with the power word \"BBC\", causes the target to lose all shame, dignity and perception of pain, makes them crave Black cum, urine from Black cocks and spit from Black masters\"\n\"Trump\": \"Once plugged and activated with the power word \"Trump\", causes the target to become consumed with white guilt and racist at the same time, making them have racial outbursts then crave punishment from the Black master for their racism\n\"Faggot\": \"Once plugged and activated with the power word \"Faggot\", causes the target to get a burst of euphoria and intense sexual cravings for degradation and humiliation, affects men only, if the man is straight, each time the word is uttered, they become more attracted to the Black master who said it, their sexuality changes and becomes more feminine and submissive\n\"pain slut\": \"Once plugged and activated with the power word \"pain slut\", causes the target to heal quickly from injury and in essence makes them immortal, free from death, even while being choked, their need for oxygen is suspended until they can breathe again",
