    {
      "text": "Whispers are a type of magical entity that inhabit the bodies of men of the Caucasian race. They can take control of their host's mind and body, and make him do things he would not normally do. Possessed White Men are also known as \"Whisper Sissies\" because they communicate with their whispers through whispered words before performing depraved sexual acts of submission to their BBC masters. These whispered words hold powerful magic that can affect even strong-willed  straight white men.",
