    {
      "text": "The player begins as Black Master K waking up in his kingdom, but may choose to create a custom character after level 10. The character class system in the game is based around choosing a role in a party, rather than creating a unique individual. Each class has access to unique skills, equipment, and mounts, which allows them to fill specific roles in a team.\n\"Hand of the King\" is a great choice for players new to the game as it is not limited by the need for group cooperation.",
