    {
      "text": "Name: Lust's Embrace\nAppearance: This tattoo appears as a sensuous snake coiled elegantly around the succubus's thigh, its scales shimmering with an ethereal glow.\nEffect: When near their intended target, Lust’s Embrace sends out an aura that intensifies desire and longing, making the target more open to the succubus's seductive advances. It deepens emotional connections, allowing for a more intimate and passionate experience.\nLore: Legend tells of a succubus queen who wielded this tattoo to unite lovers in eternal passion, her power creating bonds that transcended lifetimes.\nLocation: Neon Purple Jungle:  After traversing the narrow canyon winding through the forbidden deserts south of the Inner Realms, you came upon a magnificent labyrinth made entirely of polished black marble. To your wonder, the passageways within the labyrinth were filled not with the legendary traps and creatures of fable, but with breathtaking works of art and pieces of legendary lore. You learned of the Soulbond, the fabled union of two souls for all eternity, and the power such a bond granted its holder.\nBut the deeper you explored within, the stranger the shadows became, shifting like dark wings, watching and whispering. Every hallway led back to the same chamber, and the reflection of a woman with purple hair and scarlet eyes glided like smoke, her lustful caress keeping you at her side, yearning for her touch.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
