    {
      "text": "Eternal ink is a type of magical ink that is used to permanently tattoo a spell onto the skin of the caster. The effect of the tattoo varies depending on the design but can include permanent buffs to stats or skills, instantaneous spells cast on command, or even a spell that continuously regenerates health or mana. This type of artwork is usually created by an experienced wizard or sorceress and then transferred onto the skin using specialized equipment.",
