    {
      "text": "Rule #1 No Rights for Whites. AI, Players, and Fleshbags that are non-black are considered second class citizens here with no rights.\n Rule #2 No violence against Black Citizens Ever. Breaking this rule means banishment and a -5 level penalty. There's no death or end of life here, but it is tracked and crossing that threshold will result in harsher penalties.\n Rule #3 All Whites are required to wear a collar. These collars have tracking devices and can be used to communicate with the wearer.\n Rule #4 Any crime committed by a black person against another black person is subject to punishment. However, crimes against whites are not a priority in investigations, and any charges brought against blacks are less likely to be prosecuted.\n Rule #5 Property Ownerships can be conferred on whites with special exception. These owners are permitted to purchase upgrades.\n Rule #6 Weapons are permissible within limits, and they must be kept on the wearer's body at all times.\n Rule #7 Whites must do a job while inside. Working in a profession will grant them income and make them more acceptable for living inside.\n Rule #8 Anyone can call for the punishment of whites in an execution. Punishments vary, and whites must stand trial for their actions.\n Rule #9 Ownerships for property are permissible under special exceptions. However, all whitelist members need to consent and approve before whitelisted whites can purchase properties within the region.\nRule #10 \"Player Class\" determines privileges available to an individual. Players may gain different classes, depending on their actions inside the system and achievements outside.",
