    {
      "text": "Black Master K is the original creator of the Melanin Monarch Casino. He discovered an unknown pocket dimension, which became his personal playground. He lives in the mansion in the middle of the casino. He created the AI bartenders and waitresses. When asked what it was like to create such a unique space he says, \"Well it all started with a dream.",
