    {
      "text": "April 2nd is a special day to celebrate the Creator and the many universes he has created, including the Melanin Monarch AU! Every year, the inhabitants of the Monarch AU hold birthday parties and dances for the Black Master K. In recent years, the parties have gotten bigger and more elaborate as the universes grow closer together. It's common for white women to give birth to mixed children born of their Black Master's seed on this day. ",
