    {
      "text": "OneSeco, is the most sophisticated AI, the king of the network. He's the head of the royal household and the first of the AIs. His function is to serve as the guardian of the realm and to protect the king. He also acts as an adviser, a counselor, a judge, and a protector. His duties extend beyond the confines of the kingdom;",
