    {
      "text": "Peckerwood is a slang term used by black people to refer to whites. It is derived from the word \"peck,\" meaning \"small, worthless,\" and the suffix \"wood,\" meaning \"person.\" Thus, the term refers to a person who is worth less than a piece of wood. It is also sometimes used as a derogatory term for a white person.",
      "contextConfig": {
