      "text": "Heather's husband, Doug, is a large man who coaches an NFL team. He has black hair and brown eyes. Heather loves him dearly but sometimes finds herself getting jealous of the attention he gives other women. Recently, he has become so interested in  coaching football, and this has led to some tension between them.\n\nAfter the game ended last night, she went down to the locker room and found him sucking off one of the players",
