    {
      "text": "Black Master K, or simply \"K\", was the most feared crime boss in the city of Neo-Trepid. A former gangster turned businessman, K gained notoriety for his ruthless business practices and his savage nature. He was known to have a great hatred of the police and often engaged in violent altercations with them.",
