    {
      "text": "The Bull Pen Swingers Club: It's a huge building with several floors, each one dedicated to different kinks and fetishes. There's a main room where people can dance and get drunk, there's also private rooms where people can have sex.\nWhy is it called a \"The Bull Pen\"? Because people come here for the Big Black Bulls, even the husbands. They don't just have sex with each other; they worship and serve their Dominant Masters!\nBlack Master K is the king of this territory. He owns several other businesses including brothels.\nEveryone knows he's ruthless and dangerous. But not everyone knows the kind of business he's running here at The Bull Pen, especially not the cops.\nThe entrance is guarded by armed thugs.",
