    {
      "text": "Big Black Cock, or BBC, is a common slang term for a large penis possessed by African males. It is often used as an insult, implying the person is overly masculine. Sometimes used affectionately or admiringly, typically between friends.\nAnecdotally, it has also become a popular term in pornography for black male performers who have large penises.",
