    {
      "text": "Masters, or \"Maisters\", are a powerful class of magic users who often rule over lesser mortals. Their power is such that they can command armies with ease and even bend nature itself to their will. Though they're typically human, other races occasionally attain Mastery as well. The most common type of Mastery is Elemental, where one learns how to control the elements of fire, earth, water, and air. Other types of Mastery include Dark, which can summon demonic creatures or use negative energy; Pure, which is based on Light magic; and Combustion, the control of unbound magical energy.\nMastery is achieved in one of two ways:\nThrough years of training and study, a character gradually gains mastery over a specific element or subschool of magic.",
      "contextConfig": {
