    {
      "text": "Sissification is a common fetish involving the transformation of male characters into female ones. The term is usually used in conjunction with crossdressing or drag queen-like activities. Some people also refer to sissification as \"feminization.\"\nThis type of play involves wearing feminine clothing or accessories, such as makeup, wigs, high-heeled shoes, and bras. Black bulls are known for creating sissies through sissification at The Bull Pen Club",
