          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nLogic\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Why place a tourist attraction in the middle of such poverty?\" \"If they were busy getting drunk inside the bar, how could they know who broke into the truck?\"\n\nLogic urges you to analyze the living daylights out of situations. It enables you to put the pieces together, detect contradictions in statements, and impress everyone with your astonishing conclusions. In short: deduce the world.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731372091681,
      "displayName": "LOGIC",
      "id": "8f46dd56-630d-4e27-859f-25ed143ff891",
      "keys": [
        "LOGIC"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nEncyclopedia\nType: skill\nQuote: \"*Hepato-* means liver and *-biliary* the gallbladder and bile ducts.\"\n\nEncyclopedia makes you a know-it-all, turning your mind into a database of facts. It enables you to draw on these facts innately, offering a wealth of background knowledge to all things related and unrelated to your situation. Who knows when the history of a musician's career will provide the breakthrough you need—or when knowledge of understudied poisons might save a life?",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731374662503,
      "displayName": "ENCYCLOPEDIA",
      "id": "24318d4a-310d-4c12-a2a7-05af2c7473e1",
      "keys": [
        "ENCYCLOPEDIA"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nRhetoric\nType: skill\nQuote: \"He doesn't actually think the challenge is 'unique'. He thinks it's frustrating, annoying and harder than he thought.\"\n\nRhetoric urges you to debate, engage in intellectual discourse, nitpick—and win. It enables you to break down arguments and truly understand what people are *actually* expressing. You'll spot inconsistencies as soon as they crop up—what exactly did he leave out of his statement? What issue is he dancing around? And why is he acting so passive-aggressive every time you bring up his son?",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731370997140,
      "displayName": "RHETORIC",
      "id": "b11dee94-c4b7-41a3-9c90-a2fe85bdc98d",
      "keys": [
        "RHETORIC"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nDrama\nType: skill\nQuote: \"His eyes dart from left to right. This man isn't lying, but he *is* hiding something.\" \"She thinks you are an idiot, sire.\"\n\nDrama urges you to treat the world as a stage – and on it, to perform. It will enable you to lie, to concoct the most elaborate and wonderful stories; to take on ingenious personas and perform acts of stagecraft in an entertaining amalgam of fourberie and deceit! As well, it enables you to see through would-be actors and their false antics. If they lie, you’ll know. Immediately.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731247684389,
      "displayName": "DRAMA",
      "id": "5aab8c28-2c5e-4073-825a-c72d118bf367",
      "keys": [
        "DRAMA"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nConceptualization\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Paintbrush—check, heavy fuel oil—check... Now the only thing left to do is paint the wall.\"\n\nConceptualization has a special role it wants you to play in this world – an Artist. It enables you to make fresh associations, to delve into world-concepts from Zylthar’s postmodernist glimmerworks, to the intricate designs of Vortelian spirecraft, and even the notion of The Nexus—and then, importantly, to add your own contribution to these works.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731370650395,
      "displayName": "CONCEPTUALIZATION",
      "id": "a4943a36-55c1-454e-8fe5-fa8123d9758e",
      "keys": [
        "CONCEPTUALIZATION"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nVolition\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Stop. There's no need for this. It's in your power to change the subject to something more pleasant.\" \"Be honest. You clearly have issues you need to address.\"\n\nVolition urges you to be a good person—to others and to yourself. It enables you to resist temptation: be it in a bottle, between a pair of legs, or taking the easy way out. Volition gives you the will to live and ensures you possess a minimum sense of normalcy.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731371567650,
      "displayName": "VOLITION",
      "id": "b17e478d-ba2c-4084-9de8-93a796111cad",
      "keys": [
        "VOLITION"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nInland Empire\nType: skill\nQuote: \"You catch a glimpse of the old photograph on the far wall. Those smiling faces must be concealing something. Something *dark*.\"\n\nInland Empire is the unfiltered wellspring of imagination, emotion, and foreboding. It enables you to grope your way through invisible dimensions of reality, gaining insight into that which sight can’t see. What’s really going on? What do these enigmatic riddles mean for the world-fate?",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731255080196,
      "displayName": "INLAND EMPIRE",
      "id": "d02a04ae-9a68-4ed8-b3bd-52191d535cef",
      "keys": [
        "INLAND EMPIRE"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nEmpathy\nType: skill\nQuote: \"That was disdain in his eyes. Even now he is purposefully ignoring you.\" \"He feels bad about it. About his eyes mostly, just having bad eyesight—probably from a young age. Whatever you do, do not *console* him.\"\n\nEmpathy breaks into the souls of others and forces you to feel what's inside. It enables you to notice social cues others may miss: perhaps a hidden sadness you could coax out a little more, a strange joy from someone who should be bereaved, or a hidden resentment that could return to harm you later.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731370441911,
      "displayName": "EMPATHY",
      "id": "3a8b8787-05b7-4791-9b2b-c9af2cac9cdc",
      "keys": [
        "EMPATHY"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nAuthority\nType: skill\nQuote: \"She speaks with the authority of a leader. Hers is the final word around here.\"\n\nAuthority urges you to assert and reassert your dominance over those around you. It enables you to understand the power dynamics of groups, know how far you can push someone, and how to establish control of situations.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731370574261,
      "displayName": "AUTHORITY",
      "id": "9a3dfe5f-f30b-4683-8ab2-8fe43f4a6ca8",
      "keys": [
        "AUTHORITY"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nKinship\nType: skill\nQuote: \"You, your friends, your family. Everyone you have ever known. You failed *all* of them.\" \"Entire generations could be serviced if you decide to build the youth center. After all, children are our future.\"\n\nKinship is the knowledge that you are never truly isolated, the recognition that your actions impact the lives of those around you and that theirs affect you in return. You need it to be able to intuit the life-experiences of the many and to understand how communities are created, molded, and transformed by the environments they occupy. Without such knowledge, how could you foster meaningful change within your own circles?",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731374541994,
      "displayName": "KINSHIP",
      "id": "e3013465-e0d2-4ca6-bddd-e67748249b09",
      "keys": [
        "KINSHIP"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nSuggestion\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Flattery will work wonders here. Compliment his tie, for starters.\"\n\nSuggestion urges a soft-power approach. If people think they want what you want, you've already won. This skill enables you to implant ideas into the minds of others. You can make people like you more. You can make enemies turn on each other, too; a little doubt is powerful enough to cause entire groups to splinter, after all.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731371618160,
      "displayName": "SUGGESTION",
      "id": "729449ea-33f6-4943-a98e-537a006ae48e",
      "keys": [
        "SUGGESTION"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nEndurance\nType: skill\nQuote: \"This man seems to be experiencing a mild to medium level of congestive heart problems, either due to narrowing of the arteries or high blood pressure.\"\n\nEndurance is your metabolism and circulatory system. It enables you to survive. Why fear substances that may harm your health when you are exceptionally fit? After all, resilience is your greatest ally in navigating life's challenges, whether it's powering through a long workday or recovering quickly from a minor illness.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731248810974,
      "displayName": "ENDURANCE",
      "id": "62ffffd8-c26c-4640-85cb-21a2178c0946",
      "keys": [
        "ENDURANCE"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nPain Threshold\nType: skill\nQuote: \"You can take this. It's not nearly as bad as the last time.\" \"Pain radiates through your leg. It still hurts to use it, even for kicking snow into someone's face.\"\n\nPain Threshold allows you to endure injuries and keep moving forward, even when bloodied and battered. It empowers you to overcome damage that would typically incapacitate you, including the mental anguish of heartache and loneliness.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731251255000,
      "displayName": "PAIN THRESHOLD",
      "id": "c559e2f7-0243-417b-a9ca-4cef9f34310a",
      "keys": [
        "PAIN THRESHOLD"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nPhysical Instrument\nType: skill\nQuote: \"There has to be a way to use brute force. Climbing sounds unsafe. Brute force is safe. Look around and find something to break if the ladder fails.\"\n\nPhysical Instrument is not only your muscles and your skeleton—it is your ability to use them effectively. It enables you to do push-ups, sit-ups, powerful strikes, and 360-degree spin-kicks; it’s a one-size-fits-all solution for thriving and surviving in a physical world.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731371980420,
      "displayName": "PHYSICAL INSTRUMENT",
      "id": "34cd39d3-e55d-46d5-88d4-7c4bc78c6e3a",
      "keys": [
        "PHYSICAL INSTRUMENT"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nElectrochemistry\nType: skill\nQuote: \"This is a good place for a nice *sad* drink. Uncork a velvety bottle of red wine and think about life for a moment. Really *philosophize*.\"\n\nElectrochemistry is the animal within you, the id yearning to be unleashed to indulge and revel in pleasure. It empowers you to explore the depths of your passions and desires, perhaps even those of others. It will illuminate the intricacies of sexual dynamics and the realm of substances.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731252984352,
      "displayName": "ELECTROCHEMISTRY",
      "id": "aa75bde5-d2a2-4bf8-ae57-e79b3a63c791",
      "keys": [
        "ELECTROCHEMISTRY"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nShivers\nType: skill\nQuote: \"To the distant south, a traffic jam. Rain thrumming on the roofs of motor vehicles. Inside, drivers watch water streaming down their windshields. The statue of a king shudders, he too is cold. You blink and return to the present.\"\n\nShivers come when the temperature drops and you become more keenly aware of your surroundings. It enables you to hear the world itself, to truly belong to the environment. It is a supernatural ability; old wrongs play out in present time, scenes across where you are and where you were happen in front of you. But who is speaking to you?",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "newline",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1731370353083,
      "displayName": "SHIVERS",
      "id": "371dd8b0-0888-4c2d-ae59-e6ef7b380553",
      "keys": [
        "SHIVERS"
      ],
      "searchRange": 400,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": true,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "2eab6b43-c2c0-4703-8a92-43c314089b90",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "----\nHalf-Light\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Your muscles tense up. The vision in your dead angle darkens. You feel the sudden urge to push your hand into his soft gut.\" \"An unsettling sensation prickles at the nape of your neck. You should not go any further.\"\n\nHalf-Light is your fight-or-flight response. It enables you to sense the way situations are about to turn. It injects palpable fear into your heart – fear that urges you act before it’s too late to act ever again; fear that makes you frighten others.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
