      "text": "----\nCoordination\nType: skill\nQuote: \"The kid moves his hands like a basketball player dribbling fast.\" \"Chalk powder. Absorbs moisture and keeps your grip firm.\"\n\nCoordination embodies the seamless interplay between your body and the tools at your disposal. It empowers you to execute precise movements, whether catching a coin or manipulating intricate machinery. Want to navigate a crowded room without spilling your drink? Coordination has you covered. Need to disassemble a delicate device without breaking it? Absolutely.",
