      "text": "----\nPerception\nType: skill\nQuote: \"He carries the scent of fragrant shampoo and mint-flavored mouthwash.\"\n\nPerception wants you to be open to the world—with eyes, ears, and nose working at full capacity. It enables you to take in what others might overlook: the crumpled bills tucked away in the sugar bowl, the faint scent of an intruder lurking beneath the floorboards, or the nervous gulp of a passerby.",
