      "text": "----\nSavoir Faire\nType: skill\nQuote: \"An acrobatic maneuver would solve this situation. Nothing can go wrong with a good *maneuver*.\n\nSavoir Faire urges you to be better than you are: it urges you to be *cool*. Slip by others unnoticed, then tumble out the back with unexpected acrobatics. It enables you to move silent footsteps, to groove to a good beat, and to snatch useful items off people without them noticing.",
