      "text": "----\nComposure\nType: skill\nQuote: \"He keeps the language unemotional but it's in there—disappointment.\" \"You're not dressed for this weather. You should get an overcoat, or a cloak.\"\n\nComposure wants you to not crack or, at least, it wants you to not crack in front of other people. It enables you to put up a strong front. It keeps your emotions hidden from the world and helps you to read the body language of others—to sense the cracks in their own composure.",
