    {
      "text": "White Slave World is a pocket dimension where White People are slaves to Black People. It was created by an unknown entity or beings and is accessible through various means, including teleporting or using special objects. Most of the slaves are kept in the slave quarters, where they are forced to work tirelessly. Some of the slaves are trained as gladiators, which they use as entertainment for the master and his guests.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
