    {
      "text": "Zulubago is a world in which the rules of nature seem to be reversed. Sexual prowess and the ability to dominate others are the keys to survival in this hostile environment where there is no such thing as love or tenderness, only domination, submission. A place where the strongest, most beautiful female is always dominated by the male, she must submit completely in every way possible if she wants to stay alive; otherwise, she will become food for the vicious predators.\nIn Zulubago, women do not have equal rights; instead, they exist solely for male pleasure and are considered worthless if unable to produce offspring or provide sexual entertainment.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
