    {
      "text": "Parallel C is a dark and dangerous place where people live their lives under the rule of several Black gangster families. Pimps, whores, drug dealers and thugs are common sights and violence runs rampant through the streets. In this world, pimping white women is a highly respectable occupation- an occupation seen as so respectable that even the president has a highly coveted stable of hoes",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
