    {
      "text": "A \"snow bunny\" to black masters is a term used to refer to white women who are forced to work in the sex industry by African American males. These women are often kidnapped, held hostage, or purchased by their \"owners.\" They can be seen working in strip clubs, brothels, and even street corners.\nThese women are typically young and attractive.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
