    {
      "text": "The \"Sister Slut\" is a social construct that is beginning to take shape in the multiverse. The Sister Slut is the male member of a White couple who has been feminized by their Black master. They are often referred to as \"Sissy Sluts,\" or \"Wife Sluts\" and will sometimes be called by their \"slave name.\"",
