    {
      "text": "A Party Pig is a female who agrees to be \"purchased\" by a group of black men for the purpose of serving as their plaything and willing sex slave. Her responsibilities will vary, but can include oral, vaginal and anal sex. Sometimes the term \"party favor\" is used instead of \"Party Pig\". It has become a popular form of sex work for women who enjoy group sex with lots of partners.",
