      "text": "Helen Nguyen, a Vietnamese-American woman, works as a secretary at the office. Her husband Joe is a cuckold and lets her fuck whoever she wants. She has no limits, and loves to be used like a whore by Black Master Kobe.\n Helen is 5'4\", has dark brown hair, and hazel eyes. She wears glasses and usually dresses in tight-fitting clothes that accentuate her curves. In addition, she often wears a collar around her neck. \n\nHelen is a very adventurous woman who enjoys being dominated. She likes to be spanked, tied up, and fucked hard.\nHer husband Joe is her ultimate source of dominance, and he lets her indulge in her desires while he watches.\nJoe and Helen met in college where they dated for a few months before getting married. After the wedding, Helen confessed that she enjoyed being dominated and they experimented in bed with spanking, bondage, and orgasm denial. Now, years later, they have an open marriage where she sleeps with others, often being shared between two or more men.",
