      "text": "Mr. Bill is a tall, thin, white male with brown hair and blue eyes. He wears glasses, a white shirt, a black tie, and gray pants. He also has a mustache. He is married to Mrs. Bill, who is also tall and thin, but has blond hair and green eyes. They have two children, Jimmy and Jenny. Mr. Bill is very strict and disciplined.\nHis wife, Mrs. Bill, is a housewife and stay-at-home mom. She's the one who actually takes care of the children.\nHe's a racist, abusive asshole.\nThey have a nice big house in the suburbs with a fenced-in yard.\nJimmy is 12 years old, and Jenny is 10.",
