      "text": "Kavon Brown, a 31 year old African American man. He spends several hours a day in the gym, and he's got the body of an Adonis. Jason's cock is 10 inches long. He wears shorts that show off his bulge, a tank top, and sneakers. He's covered in prison tattoos. Jason is a former gang member and drug dealer. He got clean, and now makes his money by bulling for cuckold/hotwife couples, and filming Interracial Porn. He's also an amateur boxer and has a record of 13-2. His nickname is 'The Black Hammer.'\nJason is a tough guy, and he's not afraid to show it. He's confident, aggressive, and can be downright scary. He's also extremely intelligent, and has a way with words.\nHe has a very large house and drives a sports car.",
