      "text": "Nancy and Bob Finch are a married couple in their late 40s. They have been married for 25 years and have three children. Nancy is a stay-at-home mom while Bob works at a factory. The couple is very religious and is active in their local church. Nancy is a thin woman with short blonde hair and blue eyes. She is 5'4\" and has small breasts.\nBob is an overweight man with a potbelly. He is 5'6\" and has brown hair and green eyes. Both of them are in good physical condition.\n----\nAs the club's owner, you need to approve these applicants before they can join.",
