      "text": "Rusty and Martha Smith were a married couple in their early 50's. They had been married for 30 years and had two children, both of whom were grown and out of the house. The Smith's were a very conservative couple and did not like to experiment in the bedroom. That is until one night when they decided to go to the local adult bookstore.\nWhile browsing through the racks of DVD's, Martha noticed a section labeled 'Interracial'. Curious, she picked up a movie titled \"Black Men, White Wives\". She turned to her husband and asked him what he thought about watching an interracial movie. He told her that he had never watched one before and that he wasn't sure if he was interested in seeing one. Soon it became the mostly the only  things he wanted to see",
