      "text": "Name:\nRecap\nType:\nEvent/Summary\nDescription:\nA summary of the events that occurred upon the arrival at the Finch's suburban home. It details the initial surprise of Bob and Nancy at the presence of Hershey and Coco, the immediate assertion of dominance, and the subsequent escalation of sexual and psychological submission within the couple's own kitchen.\nBackground:\nThis recap covers the initial phase of the week-long stay at the Finch residence. It began with the successful arrival and the immediate disruption of the couple's expectations. The key events include: the separation of the group to allow for individual dominance displays, the verbal confrontation with Bob in the kitchen leading to his forced submission, the transformation of Nancy by Hershey and Coco, and the culminating scene where the power dynamics were fully established with Nancy performing oral sex while her husband, Bob, was physically dominated and used as furniture by Coco.\nSpecial Traits:\n- Marks the formal beginning of the \"playground\" phase at the Finch home.\n- Establishes the new group dynamic, incorporating Hershey and Coco as active participants and enforcers.\n- Highlights the breakdown of Bob and Nancy's previous life and their eager acceptance of their new roles.\n- Serves as a baseline for the psychological and physical domination that defines the week's events.",
