      "text": "----\nHouse Rules for Bob and Nancy\nType: Protocol\nPurpose: Establishes the new domestic hierarchy and daily conduct for Bob and Nancy under Master K's ownership.\nRule #1: Address: You will address me as \"Nigger Daddy\" at all times. You will speak only when spoken to, and your responses will begin and end with \"Yes, Nigger Daddy.\"\nRule #2: Attire: Wear the slut clothes during the day, you will remain naked at night. Keep yourself hairless and smooth.\nRule #3: Movement: Bob will not walk upright in my bedroom. You will crawl on his hands and knees. Nancy will come and go as she pleases\nRule #4: Chastity: Bob's worthless cock will remain locked at all times. He is forbidden from touching it, or himself, for any reason without explicit permission. \nRule5: Black Masters: All of my black brothers are kings that deserve the same respect as me",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
