      "text": "\"The Wave\" is a slang term used to describe the effects of a powerful new street drug that has become popular among teens and young adults. It is often sold in small tablets or capsules, and its effects are said to be similar to those of Ecstasy, but more powerful. Some users report experiencing feelings of intense euphoria, an exponential increase in sexual craving and aggression, while others say the effects are more like those of a pleasure seeking and enhancing drug. .",
